My pick: Electric Lime — #B8FF2C
It would work extremely well with your current palette:

- Primary Cyan: #00D9FF
- Deep Black: #03070A
- White: #F5F7F8
- NEW Accent — Electric Lime: #B8FF2C
  Where to use the lime
  Don't use it everywhere. Keep it as a small premium highlight

color pallele :
--black: #03070A;
--black-soft: #081116;
--cyan: #09c8ec;
--lime: #B8FF2C;
--white: #F5F7F8;
--muted: #8B9AA3;
--border: rgba(255,255,255,0.10);

